  "wkFaqW1Q": "When do I get paid?",
  "wkFaqW1A": "The customer pays BuildCrew before you start, so the money is safe. When the customer confirms the work and rates you, it goes to your UPI the same day. If the customer says nothing for 48 hours, it is released automatically.",
  "wkFaqW2Q": "What if the customer does not pay?",
  "wkFaqW2A": "Start work only after the app shows the customer has paid. BuildCrew holds that money safely. If the customer does not respond or is unfair, tap Report a problem and we will help.",
  "wkFaqW3Q": "What is the start code?",
  "wkFaqW3A": "When you reach the site, the customer gives you a short code. Enter it in the app to check in. It proves you really arrived.",
  "wkFaqW4Q": "What if the customer cancels?",
  "wkFaqW4A": "If the customer cancels before work starts, their money is refunded and you are free to take other jobs. You can also leave a job before starting from My Work.",
  "wkFaqW5Q": "What is a warranty re-fix?",
  "wkFaqW5A": "If the customer reports a problem with finished work during the warranty, you visit again for free. It shows as Warranty re-fix.",
  "wkFaqW6Q": "What if we disagree about the work?",
  "wkFaqW6A": "The customer can ask you to fix things up to 3 times. After that, or if you feel it is unfair, tap Report a problem. The money stays safe while our team checks photos, chat and attendance.",
  "wkFaqW7Q": "What is police verification?",
  "wkFaqW7A": "It is optional. Ask for it in Profile under Verification. Verified workers get a badge and customers trust them more.",
  "wkFaqW8Q": "Do I pay any fee?",
  "wkFaqW8A": "No. Quoting is free. The customer pays a small fixed fee of Rs 30. You receive the full price you quoted.",
  "wkFaqW9Q": "How do I stay safe?",
  "wkFaqW9A": "Share your trip with someone you trust, never take or give money outside the app, and leave any site that feels unsafe. Call support if you need help.",
  "wkFaqW10Q": "How do ratings work?",
  "wkFaqW10A": "Customers rate quality, time, behaviour and value. Good ratings bring more jobs and badges. You also rate the customer.",
  "wkFaqC1Q": "How does payment work?",
  "wkFaqC1A": "When you accept a quote you pay the price plus a Rs 30 fee. BuildCrew holds the money safely. The worker gets it only after you confirm and rate the work.",
  "wkFaqC2Q": "When is the worker paid?",
  "wkFaqC2A": "After you confirm the work and rate it. If you do nothing for 48 hours after the worker marks it done, payment is released automatically.",
  "wkFaqC3Q": "What is the start code?",
  "wkFaqC3A": "When the worker is on the way you see a short code. Tell it to the worker only when they reach your site. It confirms the right person arrived.",
  "wkFaqC4Q": "Can I cancel and get a refund?",
  "wkFaqC4A": "Yes. Before work starts you get a full refund of price and fee. After work starts, tap Report a problem so our team can decide fairly.",
  "wkFaqC5Q": "What if the work has a problem later?",
  "wkFaqC5A": "Use Ask for re-fix on the finished job. The worker visits again free of charge during the warranty.",
  "wkFaqC6Q": "What if I am not happy?",
  "wkFaqC6A": "Send the work back for a fix (up to 3 times) or tap Report a problem. Your money stays safe until our team decides.",
  "wkFaqC7Q": "Are workers verified?",
  "wkFaqC7A": "Workers verify their phone and ID. Some also have police verification, shown as a badge.",
  "wkFaqC8Q": "What are the fees?",
  "wkFaqC8A": "A fixed fee of Rs 30 is added to the worker's price. There are no other hidden charges.",
  "wkFaqC9Q": "How can I stay safe?",
  "wkFaqC9A": "Check the worker's rating and badges, share the live trip with family, keep valuables safe, and pay only in the app. Call support if something feels wrong.",
  "wkFaqC10Q": "What if the worker does not come?",
  "wkFaqC10A": "Report it on the job screen or call support. Your money is refunded in full."
}
